  data: {
    LLM: 'Deal 12 each. Auction: players bid in turn or pass; highest bidder declares trump. Both players lay melds face-up, tally, return cards to hand. Trick play: bid winner leads; must follow suit, must play trump when void in suit; must overtrump when possible in some rules. Counters (A, 10, K) score 10 each; last trick 10. Total 250 trick points per hand.',
    Player: 'Deal 12 each. Auction: players bid in turn or pass; highest bidder declares trump. Both players lay melds face-up, tally, return cards to hand. Trick play: bid winner leads; must follow suit, must play trump when void in suit; must overtrump when possible in some rules. Counters (A, 10, K) score 10 each; last trick 10. Total 250 trick points per hand.',
    objective: 'Score points via melds and trick-taking; first to reach agreed target (e.g. 1000) wins, or win by making your bid (meld plus trick points).',
    gameplay: 'Deal 12 each. Auction: players bid in turn or pass; highest bidder declares trump. Both players lay melds face-up, tally, return cards to hand. Trick play: bid winner leads; must follow suit, must play trump when void in suit; must overtrump when possible in some rules. Counters (A, 10, K) score 10 each; last trick 10. Total 250 trick points per hand.',
    keyRules: [
